OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few light showers at first
OL,6,Fthis morning otherwise mainly dry,
OL,7,FThis afternoon will be cloudy with a
OL,8,Flittle light and patchy rain spreading
OL,9,Ffrom the west later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain will spread across all
OL,12,Fparts from the west for a time this
OL,13,Fevening. Then turning drier and
OL,14,Fclearer during the early hours with a
OL,15,Ffew showers.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FA windy day with bright
OL,18,Fspells and scattered showers, becoming
OL,19,Fdrier by eveniing. Fresh occasionally
OL,20,Fstrong westerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
