OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,6,Fspreading east for a time on Friday, a
OL,7,Ffew showers following on by evening.
OL,8,FBright and breezy on Saturday with a
OL,9,Ffew showers. Dry and bright on Sunday.
